Here each tmp[i][j] computed independently; reads A[i][k] row i, B[k][j]; no cross-iteration dependencies. So we can parallelize outer i loop or collapse i,j loops. Use collapse(2). Add pragma before outer for.

Second double loop:

for (i = 0; i < _PB_NI; i++)
